# Day 44 - Secrets, Artifacts & Running Real Tests in CI ✅

Aaj maine GitHub Actions mein ye 6 tasks complete kiye:

## Task 1: GitHub Secrets
Secret ko secure tareeke se store kiya. Kabhi bhi logs mein print nahi karna.

## Task 2: Secrets as Environment Variables
Secret ko env variable mein pass kiya.

## Task 3: Upload Artifacts
Test report generate karke upload kiya aur download karke verify kiya.

## Task 4: Download Artifacts Between Jobs
Job 1 se Job 2 mein data share kiya.

## Task 5: Run Real Tests in CI
Python script run ki, intentionally fail kiya (🔴), phir fix kiya (🟢).

## Task 6: Caching
Dependencies cache kiye - 25 seconds se 5 seconds ho gaya!

## Key Learnings
🔐 Secrets - kabhi logs mein mat dikhao
📦 Artifacts - jobs ke beech data share karo
🧪 Tests - bugs early catch karo
⚡ Cache - workflow speed up karo

